<Style backgroundColor="#ffffff" bodyColor="#ffffff" bodyXPadding="24" bodyYPadding="32" textBaseColor="#17202a" textLinkColor="#ec3750" buttonBodyColor="#ec3750" buttonTextColor="#ffffff" buttonBorderRadius="6" />
<H3>Hack Club</H3>
<H1>Your NDA is signed</H1>
<Paragraph fontSize="16" lineHeight="165">Hi {data.signer_fullName},</Paragraph>
<Paragraph fontSize="16" lineHeight="165">Your Hack Club Contributor Non-Disclosure Agreement is signed and on file as of {data.nda_signedOn}. You can download a PDF copy any time from your NDA page.</Paragraph>
<Button href="{data.nda_agreementUrl}">View your agreement</Button>
<Paragraph fontSize="13" lineHeight="160">Or paste this link into your browser:<Br />{data.nda_agreementUrl}</Paragraph>
<Paragraph fontSize="14" lineHeight="160">Thanks for taking this seriously — keeping other people's data safe is a real responsibility.</Paragraph>
<Divider />
<Paragraph fontSize="12" lineHeight="170"><Strong>The Hack Foundation</Strong>, a 501(c)(3) nonprofit<Br />212 Battery St., Shelburne, VT 05401, USA<Br />This message concerns a legal agreement. Keep it for your records.</Paragraph>
